WEBVTT

01:30.289 --> 01:34.910
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.250 --> 01:37.870
[Episode 40]

01:52.430 --> 01:53.280
Demon King,

01:54.310 --> 01:56.200
our two duels

01:56.509 --> 01:58.310
were both interrupted halfway.

01:58.509 --> 01:59.350
This time,

02:00.310 --> 02:01.910
no one will be able to stop us.

03:06.590 --> 03:08.190
Those three strikes just now

03:08.710 --> 03:09.910
were for Ao Hen,

03:10.840 --> 03:11.800
Qiong Qi,

03:12.590 --> 03:13.840
and Teng She.

03:14.590 --> 03:16.450
Back in the Realm of Mist and Void,

03:16.630 --> 03:17.760
if it weren't for you

03:17.870 --> 03:18.800
and Xiao Yao,

03:19.240 --> 03:21.800
Pianpian, Tan'er, and I

03:22.190 --> 03:23.990
wouldn't have made it out alive.

03:24.310 --> 03:25.970
Consider those three strikes

03:26.120 --> 03:28.380
as repayment for that debt of gratitude.

03:29.590 --> 03:31.120
Now that the debt is settled

03:32.030 --> 03:34.230
and the mirror fragments are complete,

03:34.710 --> 03:36.970
it's time for me to take everything back.

03:37.240 --> 03:38.079
Dream on.

04:45.950 --> 04:46.880
I'm alive again?

04:54.680 --> 04:56.480
I've regained my physical form.

05:05.120 --> 05:05.920
Bingzhu!

05:06.750 --> 05:07.920
I'm Tan'er!

05:08.270 --> 05:09.680
I'm Tan'er!

05:28.950 --> 05:29.600
Bingzhu!

05:30.360 --> 05:31.560
I'm Tan'er!

05:32.560 --> 05:33.390
Bingzhu!

05:34.270 --> 05:34.830
Bingzhu!

05:35.430 --> 05:36.430
Stop fighting!

05:37.000 --> 05:38.000
Stop it, now!

05:38.120 --> 05:38.870
Pianpian?

05:39.600 --> 05:40.430
Pianpian!

05:43.630 --> 05:44.360
Xiao Yao!

05:45.390 --> 05:45.920
Xiao Yao.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.159
I'm Tan'er.

05:50.270 --> 05:51.830
I'm in Pianpian's body!

05:52.830 --> 05:54.040
I really am Tan'er!

05:55.190 --> 05:56.480
The demon-slaying blade!

05:56.480 --> 05:57.940
The demon-slaying blade!

06:20.680 --> 06:21.240
Xiao Yao,

06:21.600 --> 06:23.270
we've got to make them stop fighting.

06:23.270 --> 06:24.730
Let's stop them together.

06:24.870 --> 06:26.070
Watch out behind you!

06:31.390 --> 06:34.790
Who would've thought that
after the Immortal Lord and Tan'er

06:35.040 --> 06:36.830
merged into one, you'd actually be
less formidable than before?

06:36.830 --> 06:38.600
Trading you for the Kunlun Mirror

06:38.600 --> 06:40.130
isn't too much to ask, is it?

06:40.800 --> 06:41.430
Xiao Yao!

06:57.510 --> 06:58.270
Xiao Yao.

07:36.120 --> 07:36.800
Xiao Mu.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.430
Xiao Mu!

07:41.480 --> 07:42.190
Xiao Mu.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.630
Xiao Mu!

08:12.160 --> 08:13.390
You two, stop it now!

08:14.070 --> 08:15.000
Stop fighting!

08:16.000 --> 08:16.600
Bingzhu!

08:16.750 --> 08:17.600
Please stop!

08:17.870 --> 08:18.800
Stop fighting!

08:24.310 --> 08:25.070
Xiao Yao?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.240
Pianpian?

08:38.390 --> 08:39.030
Pianpian.

08:41.240 --> 08:41.840
Xiao Yao.

08:41.840 --> 08:42.440
Hong Ye.

08:45.150 --> 08:45.670
Xiao Mu!

08:46.910 --> 08:47.570
Don't move.

08:48.750 --> 08:50.150
-Stay still!
-My Lord...

08:52.320 --> 08:53.120
My Lord.

08:54.000 --> 08:56.120
Please don't be sad, My Lord.

08:57.550 --> 08:59.080
Even if I, Xiao Mu, am gone,

09:01.440 --> 09:03.910
Xiao Ming will still be by your side.

09:05.550 --> 09:06.440
Xiao Ming,

09:08.240 --> 09:10.720
we've only got one life left.

09:12.440 --> 09:14.320
Use it wisely, will you?

09:15.600 --> 09:16.150
Xiao Mu!

09:16.790 --> 09:17.450
Don't move.

09:20.270 --> 09:21.120
My Lord.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.510
Xiao Ming

09:25.320 --> 09:28.480
is in your care now.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.500
You'll be alright.

09:36.750 --> 09:37.270
Xiao Mu!

09:41.600 --> 09:42.150
Xiao Mu?

09:44.910 --> 09:45.480
Xiao Mu.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.960
My Lord,

10:04.960 --> 10:07.600
Xiao Mu is gone.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.240
My Lord,

10:10.120 --> 10:11.030
from now on,

10:12.320 --> 10:16.630
it'll be just me, Xiao Ming,
staying by your side.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.360
My Lord...

10:26.870 --> 10:28.080
My Lord!

10:37.000 --> 10:37.600
Pianpian.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.200
What exactly...

10:39.200 --> 10:40.150
I am Tan'er.

10:43.390 --> 10:43.750
You...

10:43.750 --> 10:45.350
Bingzhu, I really am Tan'er.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.800
What are you talking about?

10:50.390 --> 10:51.240
General.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.700
I don't want fine clothes,

10:57.240 --> 10:58.370
I don't want a house,

10:58.550 --> 11:00.010
and I don't want a husband.

11:00.510 --> 11:01.440
All I want is for you to become

11:01.440 --> 11:03.500
that happy, carefree Bingzhu again.

11:04.870 --> 11:05.400
Bingzhu,

11:06.000 --> 11:07.270
with your martial skills,

11:07.270 --> 11:07.870
after you join the army,

11:07.870 --> 11:09.870
you'll surely become a great general.

11:09.870 --> 11:10.910
Consider this money

11:10.910 --> 11:12.120
a loan from me.

11:13.510 --> 11:14.750
When you become a general,

11:14.750 --> 11:16.550
you'd better pay me back double.

11:18.120 --> 11:19.630
Once I become a general,

11:20.840 --> 11:22.840
I'll buy you the finest clothes, Tan'er.

11:22.840 --> 11:23.080
Mm!

11:23.080 --> 11:24.810
We'll live in the finest house.

11:25.550 --> 11:26.880
And when the time comes,

11:27.080 --> 11:28.440
I'll also find you

11:28.440 --> 11:29.970
the most virtuous husband.

11:30.670 --> 11:31.390
Bingzhu.

11:31.720 --> 11:32.630
I don't want a husband.

11:32.630 --> 11:33.830
Having you is enough.

11:38.480 --> 11:38.910
You...

11:42.790 --> 11:44.390
So you're really Tan'er?

11:46.120 --> 11:47.510
In truth, many times
when I do not leave my sheath,

11:47.510 --> 11:49.310
it isn't entirely out of my will.

11:49.440 --> 11:51.440
It's because you yourself also know

11:51.960 --> 11:53.290
that the demon before us

11:53.510 --> 11:55.120
is not truly wicked—

11:57.510 --> 11:59.720
you just don't want to admit it.

12:05.200 --> 12:06.000
Tan'er.

12:07.790 --> 12:09.120
So what about Pianpian?

12:09.510 --> 12:10.320
Where is she?

12:14.910 --> 12:16.200
When I woke up,

12:18.360 --> 12:21.080
I was already in Pianpian's body,

12:23.080 --> 12:25.080
and my soul had been fully restored.

12:27.840 --> 12:30.100
But I couldn't sense her presence at all.

12:34.600 --> 12:36.270
My last wish

12:40.670 --> 12:41.800
is for you and Tan'er

12:44.390 --> 12:45.030
to be

12:47.000 --> 12:47.960
reunited

12:49.360 --> 12:50.620
as brother and sister.

12:52.840 --> 12:53.720
I want

12:54.910 --> 12:56.870
to see Tan'er one more time.

13:11.440 --> 13:13.320
As long as I find the Yuli Spring,

13:15.910 --> 13:18.000
everything will be alright.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.790
Just wait for me.

13:28.150 --> 13:29.080
I cannot...

13:31.200 --> 13:32.510
Wait any longer...

13:44.750 --> 13:45.320
Bingzhu.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.750
It was Pianpian who saved me.

13:59.360 --> 13:59.910
Bingzhu.

14:06.870 --> 14:07.960
Let's go home.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.040
Let's go home.

14:16.910 --> 14:17.630
Tan'er...

14:21.390 --> 14:22.360
Let's go home.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.160
Let's go home.

15:01.870 --> 15:02.480
Aging,

15:03.440 --> 15:04.040
sickness,

15:04.670 --> 15:05.200
and death

15:06.360 --> 15:08.020
—the three mirror fragments,

15:08.150 --> 15:08.750
as well as

15:09.600 --> 15:10.860
the fate of both demons

15:11.320 --> 15:12.550
and humans alike—

15:13.360 --> 15:14.750
I'll leave it all to you.

15:21.360 --> 15:22.120
In this life,

15:23.360 --> 15:24.670
I will atone for my sins

15:25.720 --> 15:27.120
in my own way.

15:30.390 --> 15:33.030
Neither the wealth and splendor
of the human realm

15:33.030 --> 15:35.690
nor the blissful immortality
of the Yuli Spring

15:36.630 --> 15:38.560
has anything to do with us anymore.

15:51.440 --> 15:53.040
I hope you'll keep your word.

16:16.960 --> 16:17.600
Xiao Yao.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.200
Take care.

16:59.880 --> 17:02.650
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

17:04.230 --> 17:06.890
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

17:08.520 --> 17:11.140
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

17:12.520 --> 17:15.150
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

17:16.960 --> 17:19.790
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

17:21.369 --> 17:23.980
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

17:22.000 --> 17:23.130
A hundred years ago,

17:25.000 --> 17:27.160
the Kunlun Mirror
fell into my hands the same way.

17:25.660 --> 17:28.380
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

17:28.510 --> 17:30.070
Yet every time it appeared,

17:29.880 --> 17:32.280
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

17:31.550 --> 17:32.680
all it ever awakened

17:34.160 --> 17:35.110
was pain.

17:41.750 --> 17:43.110
I'll go with you.

17:55.690 --> 17:58.460
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

18:00.040 --> 18:02.700
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

18:04.330 --> 18:06.910
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

18:08.330 --> 18:10.960
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

18:12.770 --> 18:15.600
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

18:17.180 --> 18:19.790
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

18:21.470 --> 18:24.190
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

18:25.690 --> 18:28.090
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

18:29.950 --> 18:33.090
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

18:32.200 --> 18:34.480
The Kunlun Mirror gathers desire—

18:34.230 --> 18:37.260
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

18:35.510 --> 18:37.570
never dispersing, never perishing.

18:37.590 --> 18:40.920
Only by dissolving the millennia
of suffering amassed within it

18:38.670 --> 18:41.620
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

18:41.440 --> 18:43.790
and allowing every soul
to let go of its obsessions

18:42.810 --> 18:45.790
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

18:44.240 --> 18:46.500
will the Kunlun Mirror truly disappear.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.270
Join me.

19:50.110 --> 19:51.440
It's been 10,000 years,

19:52.920 --> 19:54.580
yet nothing has changed here.

20:39.400 --> 20:40.930
I remember everything now.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.920
Ten thousand years ago,

20:46.720 --> 20:48.850
I lived one lifetime as a human prince.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.320
Drifting on a boat at sea,

20:55.350 --> 20:57.410
the noodles in that fishing village,

20:59.510 --> 21:00.970
the bone flute you gave me,

21:05.200 --> 21:07.000
and our wedding in the desert...

21:09.310 --> 21:10.110
Xiao Yao,

21:13.110 --> 21:14.510
I took advantage of you.

21:17.440 --> 21:18.110
I'm sorry.

21:30.270 --> 21:31.400
After 10,000 years,

21:32.920 --> 21:33.980
the debt between us

21:35.790 --> 21:37.190
has already been repaid.

21:44.640 --> 21:46.070
You're too naive.

21:47.200 --> 21:49.530
The Kunlun Mirror can never be destroyed.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.750
Whether human or demon,

21:51.750 --> 21:53.160
there's always desire—

21:53.750 --> 21:56.240
coveting what's not meant to be theirs.

21:57.160 --> 21:59.480
Desire stirs conflict in the world,

21:59.880 --> 22:02.350
keeping it in perpetual turmoil.

22:03.310 --> 22:04.720
A world ruled by desire

22:04.720 --> 22:05.920
is easier to control.

22:07.160 --> 22:10.490
The Yuli Spring is an ocean
where the deities gather desire,

22:11.160 --> 22:15.020
and the Kunlun Mirror is the conduit
through which that desire flows.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.820
Since it cannot be destroyed,

22:19.830 --> 22:21.270
we can co-exist with it.

22:26.350 --> 22:28.640
If I seal the Kunlun Mirror
within my body

22:30.640 --> 22:32.110
and then seal myself away—

22:33.070 --> 22:34.470
neither living nor dead,

22:35.110 --> 22:37.170
never dispersing, never perishing—

22:37.750 --> 22:40.480
the Yuli Spring will cease to exist
in this world.

22:42.400 --> 22:43.060
You cannot.

23:29.720 --> 23:32.030
All of this began because of me.

23:34.880 --> 23:37.010
Now, it can only be repaid by me as well.

23:56.070 --> 23:56.920
Hong Ye!

23:56.920 --> 23:57.830
Come back!

24:14.210 --> 24:17.630
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

24:18.600 --> 24:21.810
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

24:27.270 --> 24:28.240
Hong Ye...

24:28.380 --> 24:31.630
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

24:32.660 --> 24:36.850
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

24:34.000 --> 24:34.920
Sorry.

24:39.000 --> 24:40.240
I cannot fulfill

24:40.340 --> 24:42.730
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

24:41.960 --> 24:43.360
the promise I made to you.

24:43.670 --> 24:46.040
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

24:46.980 --> 24:51.290
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

24:54.460 --> 24:56.890
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

24:57.830 --> 25:00.280
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

25:02.480 --> 25:04.610
♪ Boiling hot ♪

25:08.960 --> 25:09.680
Xiao Yao.

25:09.190 --> 25:11.680
♪ The armor I dare not cast away ♪

25:12.630 --> 25:15.040
♪ The red cheeks ♪

25:17.080 --> 25:18.650
♪ Cold ♪

25:23.410 --> 25:25.820
♪ I'm afraid it's a dream ♪

25:26.900 --> 25:28.550
♪ A thousand years is just ♪

25:29.420 --> 25:34.170
♪ A fleeting moment's grand display ♪

25:38.300 --> 25:42.580
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

25:43.580 --> 25:47.920
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

25:48.980 --> 25:51.730
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

25:52.800 --> 25:54.300
♪ The chains of fate ♪

25:55.260 --> 25:59.040
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

26:00.030 --> 26:03.550
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

26:04.400 --> 26:05.900
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

26:06.930 --> 26:08.440
♪ Both flushing ♪

26:09.380 --> 26:12.990
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

26:13.910 --> 26:19.040
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

26:22.380 --> 26:25.830
♪ Moments ♪

26:47.830 --> 26:48.480
Today,

26:49.030 --> 26:51.160
we're testing transformation techniques.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.440
Those who fail

26:52.440 --> 26:54.100
will have to stay after class.

26:59.720 --> 27:00.850
Little Dragon Girl.

27:01.550 --> 27:02.280
You go first.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.440
Did you collect hair

27:07.440 --> 27:10.100
from teachers and friends
you're familiar with

27:11.030 --> 27:12.000
as I asked?

27:22.960 --> 27:24.290
My bed collapsed again.

27:24.510 --> 27:27.040
Betroth your second cousin to me
as my new bed.

27:30.480 --> 27:31.880
Such impudence.

27:32.240 --> 27:33.840
No respect for elders at all!

27:43.000 --> 27:44.000
But your imitation of that fool

27:44.000 --> 27:45.460
was remarkably accurate.

27:45.920 --> 27:46.590
Remember—

27:47.200 --> 27:48.440
practice diligently,

27:48.440 --> 27:49.960
and never grow arrogant or complacent.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.310
Mm.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.320
You may go.

27:52.510 --> 27:53.640
Little Dragon Girl:

27:54.110 --> 27:54.920
top grade.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.310
Teacher,

28:19.720 --> 28:20.920
you've eaten so much again.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.520
Please tell us more stories.

28:24.750 --> 28:25.350
Sure.

28:27.510 --> 28:29.110
Where did I leave off last time?

28:29.110 --> 28:29.400
-Last time...
-Last time,

28:29.400 --> 28:31.160
you were telling us about
destroying the Qionghua Sect.

28:31.160 --> 28:31.550
That's right.

28:31.550 --> 28:32.030
Where?

28:32.030 --> 28:34.160
-Destroying the Qionghua Sect.
-Yes.

28:40.590 --> 28:41.920
Teacher, what's wrong?

28:42.000 --> 28:42.590
Teacher?

28:43.350 --> 28:43.880
Teacher?

28:43.880 --> 28:44.750
What's wrong?

28:46.310 --> 28:46.770
This...

28:47.550 --> 28:49.000
Teacher

28:49.400 --> 28:51.240
must have been reminded of

28:51.240 --> 28:53.310
that tragic love story.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.510
Let's not talk about it.
Let's skip this part.

28:56.510 --> 28:59.480
The Realm of Mist and Void.
The Realm of Mist and Void instead.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.000
Let's not talk about that.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.310
You want to know about
the Realm of Mist and Void?

29:01.310 --> 29:02.000
Yes.

29:04.400 --> 29:05.860
That Realm of Mist and Void

29:06.440 --> 29:08.200
is a small island in the sea

29:08.720 --> 29:09.850
guarded by spirits.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.960
Normally, neither humans nor demons

29:11.960 --> 29:14.030
can find the entrance to that realm.

29:15.160 --> 29:17.420
It was only because of my good luck
that I,

29:17.750 --> 29:21.280
along with Dali, the most beautiful
goddess of Demons' Valley,

29:21.350 --> 29:23.000
obtained a painting together

29:23.000 --> 29:24.800
and finally found the entrance.

29:25.110 --> 29:26.750
Teacher, so who is Dali?

29:35.310 --> 29:35.840
Teacher?

29:36.200 --> 29:36.960
Teacher?

29:37.400 --> 29:38.000
Teacher?

29:38.200 --> 29:39.160
Let's focus on the Realm of Mist and Void.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.240
Only the Realm of Mist and Void.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.240
-Teacher.
-Teacher.

29:41.240 --> 29:42.030
Let's not talk about that.

29:42.030 --> 29:42.750
Let's focus on the Realm of Mist and Void.

29:42.750 --> 29:43.480
Please stop crying, Teacher.

29:43.480 --> 29:44.070
Teacher.

29:44.070 --> 29:46.530
Just tell us about
the Realm of Mist and Void.

29:46.880 --> 29:47.830
Teacher.

29:51.310 --> 29:52.570
Where were we just now?

29:54.960 --> 29:55.560
Xiao Ming.

29:56.880 --> 29:57.310
Look.

29:58.590 --> 29:59.520
While I was gone,

30:00.160 --> 30:02.760
you let the Demons' Valley
turn into this mess.

30:04.160 --> 30:06.680
The minor demons aren't focusing on
their cultivation

30:06.680 --> 30:08.480
and only know how to play around.

30:08.830 --> 30:10.510
The way Bamboo and Luoluo teach

30:10.510 --> 30:12.030
is also terrible.

30:15.880 --> 30:17.740
It's really unbearable to watch.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.030
Enough!

30:22.030 --> 30:23.350
Stop nagging.

30:24.070 --> 30:25.270
What can I do about it?

30:25.550 --> 30:27.550
Each generation of demons
has their own ideas.

30:27.550 --> 30:28.480
Just let them be.

30:32.640 --> 30:34.640
We can't just let things drift.

30:35.830 --> 30:37.890
You need to supervise them properly.

30:39.000 --> 30:41.530
The minor demons
who just achieved human form

30:42.590 --> 30:45.190
only admire the prosperity of
the human realm.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.930
Well, you're wrong about that.

30:50.240 --> 30:51.550
The human realm today

30:51.750 --> 30:53.550
is very different from the past.

30:54.200 --> 30:56.000
It's not as dangerous as before.

30:57.550 --> 30:59.440
Going there to gain some experience

30:59.440 --> 31:00.700
wouldn't be a bad idea.

31:07.830 --> 31:09.830
Going there to gain some experience

31:12.000 --> 31:13.480
wouldn't be a bad idea...

31:18.720 --> 31:19.590
Xiao Mu.

31:22.270 --> 31:23.270
It's been so long,

31:25.400 --> 31:28.350
yet I still haven't learned to speak
the way you do.

31:33.680 --> 31:34.480
Where on earth

31:36.240 --> 31:37.310
are you?

31:45.420 --> 31:49.800
[Hong Ye]

31:51.720 --> 31:52.510
Hong Ye.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.350
Since you left,

31:55.550 --> 31:58.150
I've been taking good care of myself
every day.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.570
I believe that you can feel

32:01.240 --> 32:02.510
my happiness as well.

32:04.720 --> 32:05.830
I will share

32:06.550 --> 32:07.950
everything that happens

32:08.110 --> 32:09.440
in the human realm

32:10.750 --> 32:11.960
and Demons' Valley with you.

32:10.800 --> 32:13.620
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

32:15.020 --> 32:17.200
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

32:15.830 --> 32:17.690
Let me start with the human realm.

32:18.030 --> 32:19.750
A few days after you left,

32:18.670 --> 32:20.920
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

32:20.960 --> 32:23.030
the old Emperor of the human clan
passed away.

32:22.260 --> 32:24.880
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

32:24.240 --> 32:24.880
I heard

32:24.880 --> 32:26.750
it was because he took
fake Yuli Spring water.

32:26.020 --> 32:29.020
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

32:27.880 --> 32:29.880
The new Emperor is young

32:29.050 --> 32:31.350
[Cyan Ink]

32:30.460 --> 32:32.670
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

32:30.750 --> 32:33.280
and doesn't obsess over immortality
all day.

32:33.920 --> 32:36.310
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

32:34.350 --> 32:34.960
By the way,

32:35.830 --> 32:37.570
the Feiyu Guards have been disbanded.

32:37.570 --> 32:39.810
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

32:38.070 --> 32:39.920
The relationship between humans and demons

32:39.920 --> 32:45.700
[The Feiyu Guards have been...]

32:40.110 --> 32:41.160
has eased considerably.

32:41.010 --> 32:43.880
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

32:41.880 --> 32:44.030
Many humans who previously
committed crimes

32:44.030 --> 32:45.590
under the banner of demons

32:45.000 --> 32:47.320
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

32:46.350 --> 32:48.010
have also been exterminated.

32:48.360 --> 32:51.560
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

32:48.960 --> 32:50.360
I believe behind all this

32:50.720 --> 32:51.980
must be Master Bingzhu

32:52.110 --> 32:53.590
and Tan'er's influence.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.930
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

32:55.440 --> 32:57.310
Before, to keep my father

32:55.940 --> 32:59.220
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

32:57.310 --> 32:59.910
away from the chaos
between humans and demons,

33:00.190 --> 33:02.630
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

33:00.200 --> 33:02.070
you placed him somewhere safe.

33:02.590 --> 33:03.240
Now,

33:03.550 --> 33:06.860
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

33:03.590 --> 33:05.240
he spends his days drinking and feasting

33:05.240 --> 33:08.110
with my uncles and elders
across mountains and lakes,

33:08.110 --> 33:13.150
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

33:08.200 --> 33:09.730
living freely and happily.

33:11.240 --> 33:13.750
Many new minor demons
have arrived at Demons' Valley,

33:13.750 --> 33:15.680
and there aren't enough teachers.

33:16.000 --> 33:16.720
Luoluo,

33:17.070 --> 33:17.680
Bamboo,

33:17.960 --> 33:18.640
and Xiaohu—

33:19.110 --> 33:20.970
they've all become teachers now.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.200
Lower.

33:25.030 --> 33:25.790
Higher.

33:26.310 --> 33:27.440
I just told you that.

33:28.270 --> 33:29.880
I said lower.

33:31.310 --> 33:32.720
D-Didn't I tell you to go higher?

33:32.720 --> 33:34.580
Hey, didn't I tell you to go lower?

33:34.720 --> 33:35.750
Didn't I tell you to go higher?

33:34.810 --> 33:37.460
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

33:35.750 --> 33:36.480
Lower.

33:36.790 --> 33:37.200
Higher.

33:37.200 --> 33:37.790
Lower.

33:38.070 --> 33:38.240
Lower.

33:38.240 --> 33:38.700
Higher.

33:39.010 --> 33:41.130
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

33:39.030 --> 33:39.200
Lower.

33:39.200 --> 33:39.660
Higher.

33:40.070 --> 33:40.240
Lower.

33:40.240 --> 33:40.700
Higher.

33:42.240 --> 33:43.030
My noodles

33:42.710 --> 33:45.080
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

33:43.440 --> 33:45.440
are also getting better and better,

33:46.350 --> 33:47.920
but of course, they're still not
as good as yours.

33:46.480 --> 33:48.390
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

33:48.830 --> 33:49.510
After all,

33:49.510 --> 33:51.070
the best noodles in the world

33:49.710 --> 33:52.570
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

33:51.640 --> 33:52.900
were the ones you made.

33:53.550 --> 33:54.200
And the second

33:53.790 --> 33:56.050
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

33:54.200 --> 33:55.460
and third best noodles

33:56.640 --> 33:57.590
were also made by you.

33:56.760 --> 34:00.210
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

34:01.280 --> 34:03.500
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

34:04.620 --> 34:07.810
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

34:08.780 --> 34:11.350
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

34:12.340 --> 34:15.360
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

34:13.440 --> 34:14.070
Xiao Yao!

34:16.730 --> 34:22.250
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

34:17.920 --> 34:19.780
Why are you eating noodles again?

34:20.510 --> 34:22.110
Because they're delicious.

34:23.760 --> 34:26.480
No matter how good they are,
you can't eat them every day.

34:26.100 --> 34:27.820
♪ Our wishes ♪

34:27.230 --> 34:29.760
You can't just stay inside
like this anymore.

34:30.510 --> 34:31.510
You haven't been to

34:31.510 --> 34:33.710
the human realm in a long time, have you?

35:11.780 --> 35:13.740
[Xu's Noodles]

35:14.080 --> 35:14.370
[Xu's Noodles]

35:19.420 --> 35:22.770
[Xu's Noodles]

35:29.070 --> 35:31.150
Miss, I can't read or write.

35:31.150 --> 35:34.400
Can you help me write
my wish on the lantern?

35:32.710 --> 35:33.930
♪ My heart braves countless tribulations ♪

35:35.290 --> 35:37.350
♪ Seeking the prophecy of fate ♪

35:37.670 --> 35:38.190
Sure.

35:38.510 --> 35:39.710
What's your wish?

35:39.030 --> 35:40.500
♪ Memories are flickering ♪

35:40.230 --> 35:42.150
I want to see my mother.

35:41.670 --> 35:43.750
♪ Our fingertips touched,
and then passed ♪

35:45.190 --> 35:47.280
♪ Binding silent wishes,
witnessed by the heaven and earth ♪

35:46.280 --> 35:47.080
It's this one.

35:47.800 --> 35:49.070
This is a sky lantern.

35:48.550 --> 35:50.780
♪ I'm only waiting for you ♪

35:52.100 --> 35:54.360
♪ In a breath,
travel over millions of years ♪

35:55.590 --> 35:57.740
♪ To rewrite it ♪

35:59.090 --> 36:00.730
♪ The obsession of my life ♪

36:01.800 --> 36:03.710
♪ Has never perished
in the reincarnation ♪

36:04.720 --> 36:07.530
♪ At the very beginning of all worlds,
I'd give up everything ♪

36:08.690 --> 36:13.410
♪To reverse time and space
just to find my most beloved ♪

36:14.840 --> 36:15.670
Run!

36:14.940 --> 36:17.660
♪ Even if I have to lose my love again ♪

36:18.730 --> 36:20.860
♪ I only wish
to return to our first meeting ♪

36:21.990 --> 36:24.190
♪ Let the restricted longing ♪

36:25.540 --> 36:28.070
♪ Break the boundary of heaven and earth ♪

36:29.380 --> 36:30.780
♪ One thought turned love
into a fated calamity ♪

36:32.370 --> 36:34.240
♪ If we pray in tears ♪

36:35.480 --> 36:37.540
♪ In the vast mortal world ♪

36:38.820 --> 36:41.000
♪ Just to see you ♪

36:40.560 --> 36:48.670
[Favorable Weather]

36:42.340 --> 36:44.460
♪ Once again ♪

36:48.440 --> 36:48.970
Xiao Yao.

36:49.110 --> 36:50.510
I truly didn't see anything.

36:50.510 --> 36:52.240
I only saw you in the wooden tub.

36:53.190 --> 36:53.880
No.

36:54.190 --> 36:55.400
I-I didn't see the wooden tub.

36:55.210 --> 36:57.390
♪ Binding silent wishes,
witnessed by the heaven and earth ♪

36:55.710 --> 36:56.840
I did see the wooden tub.

36:56.840 --> 36:57.440
I just...

36:57.510 --> 36:58.550
I just didn't see you.

36:58.550 --> 36:59.550
Then I totally freaked out

36:58.620 --> 37:00.790
♪ I'm only waiting for you ♪

36:59.550 --> 37:00.480
and hid inside the wooden tub...

37:00.480 --> 37:02.080
No, I mean I hid behind the screen.

37:02.080 --> 37:04.380
♪ In a breath,
travel over millions of years ♪

37:02.230 --> 37:04.590
Are you worried that
they'd hurt the demons

37:04.590 --> 37:05.400
or...

37:05.490 --> 37:07.730
♪ Back to the beginning ♪

37:05.590 --> 37:06.030
Right.

37:06.630 --> 37:07.430
I was jealous.

37:09.260 --> 37:10.650
♪ The obsession of my life ♪

37:11.760 --> 37:13.600
♪ The contract
that fate won't let us break ♪

37:11.840 --> 37:13.770
With this lock of hair as my pledge,

37:14.030 --> 37:15.360
I formally ask for your hand in marriage,
Xiao Yao.

37:14.830 --> 37:18.010
♪ Away from the crowd,
break free from the chains ♪

37:17.590 --> 37:20.190
You are my destined husband.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.200
♪ To make it whole ♪

37:21.540 --> 37:24.210
♪ Even if I have to lose my love again ♪

37:25.470 --> 37:27.350
♪ I only wish
to return to our first meeting ♪

37:28.620 --> 37:30.710
♪ Let the restricted longing ♪

37:31.760 --> 37:32.550
I'm now

37:32.330 --> 37:34.600
♪ Break the boundary of heaven and earth ♪

37:33.150 --> 37:34.110
practicing

37:34.110 --> 37:35.670
a very powerful technique.

37:35.830 --> 37:37.360
♪ One thought turned love
into a fated calamity ♪

37:36.230 --> 37:39.030
No demon has ever mastered it before.

37:38.620 --> 37:40.660
♪ Hand in hand, we pray together ♪

37:42.270 --> 37:44.020
♪ One glance, a timeless span ♪

37:45.570 --> 37:47.500
♪ Burn up all the fleeting time ♪

37:48.950 --> 37:50.880
♪ Across the sky ♪

38:00.860 --> 38:05.970
♪ Just to be in love with you ♪

38:01.000 --> 38:02.400
What are you trying to do?

38:03.030 --> 38:06.030
Help me activate
the Time-Reversal Technique again.

38:07.480 --> 38:08.340
I can't do that.

38:08.440 --> 38:09.480
It's too dangerous.

38:09.480 --> 38:10.080
Xiao Ming.

38:11.760 --> 38:13.150
I found a special technique

38:13.150 --> 38:14.320
in an ancient scroll

38:14.920 --> 38:16.550
which, when combined with
the Time-Reversal Technique,

38:16.550 --> 38:19.030
can take me back to any moment
in my memory.

38:19.920 --> 38:22.030
I've practiced this technique
for three years,

38:22.030 --> 38:24.030
and I've finally mastered it today.

38:24.670 --> 38:25.230
So,

38:25.880 --> 38:27.480
please help me one more time.

38:29.000 --> 38:29.400
But...

38:41.000 --> 38:43.060
Which moment do you want to go back to?

41:44.480 --> 41:45.010
Xiao Yao.

41:45.510 --> 41:46.360
I've prepared something for you.

41:46.360 --> 41:46.920
Sorry.

41:47.190 --> 41:48.790
I must've got the wrong room.

42:07.760 --> 42:09.400
This seems to be my room.

42:10.840 --> 42:12.700
I've prepared something for you.

42:25.440 --> 42:26.570
Last night, you said

42:27.000 --> 42:28.200
the bed was a bit hard.

42:29.150 --> 42:31.550
Maybe it'll be better
if you lay these on it.

42:36.630 --> 42:38.360
These are all negotiable.

42:47.840 --> 42:49.440
Then I have another request.

42:53.030 --> 42:53.630
Go ahead.

43:04.840 --> 43:09.960
[Everything has started anew]
[Everything is only just beginning]
